================================================================================
Components shipped as SEPARATE WebAssembly modules
================================================================================

Gmsh                    GPL-2.0-or-later    https://gmsh.info
CalculiX (ccx)          GPL-2.0-or-later    https://calculix.de

These are GPL. They are deliberately NOT linked into FreeCAD.wasm: each is built as
its own standalone WebAssembly module (gmsh.wasm, ccx.wasm) with its own filesystem,
fetched on demand, and driven through a JavaScript bridge that copies input files in
and results back out. They are invoked as separate programs, in the same arrangement
desktop FreeCAD uses when it shells out to an installed gmsh or CalculiX binary.

Anyone redistributing this application should confirm that arrangement against their
own legal advice rather than relying on this note.

